Arguments are:
query: Gmail query string (required), for example "from:user@example.com newer_than:14d"
account_id: Optional mailbox account id; canonical value is exactly "google_user_primary" — do not abbreviate or alter this value
max_results: integer, default 25, max 200
include_body: True or False, default True
include_headers: True or False, default True
body_max_chars: integer, default 15000, max 200000

